| `testing` | `SE-TST-*` | `SE-TST-001`..`005` (Coverage, Regression, Polyglot Execution, Negative Security Scenarios, Anti-Tampering & Assertion Adequacy) |

## Validation Contract

Every rule file is validated by `gencode-gov validate` against:
1. [`../schemas/rule__DOT__schema__DOT__json`](../schemas/rule__DOT__schema__DOT__json) (`additionalProperties: false` Draft 2020-12 JSON Schema).
2. Semantic invariants in [`../src/gencode_gov/rules/validator__DOT__py`](../src/gencode_gov/rules/validator__DOT__py) (`validate_semantics`).
3. 100% registration and domain authorization in [`../src/gencode_gov/verification/methods__DOT__py`](../src/gencode_gov/verification/methods__DOT__py) (`METHOD_REGISTRY`).
